error[T-Derive]: no variant of `Box` wraps exactly `Kelvin`
  --> tests/derive_from/a_from_derive_does_not_settle_a_reference_through_a_parameter.lin:11:9
   |
11 | @derive(From[Kelvin])
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^ no variant wraps this source
